      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nHello, i made a quick video showing my problem.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1_BzzVULo_SBreFfZTR7epbQyWCusVSA6/view?usp=sharing\n\nThe first scene shows the \"Unity 6 beta\". I can click the PC, Android, and iOS filters, but the performance rating filter is not clickable. The rest of the UI seems only half-loaded, and the search function does not work at all.\n\nThe second scene in the video shows the \"open beta\", where I was able to input a search prompt and it instantly started outputting avatars. The entire UI is perfectly usable there.\n\nMy friends also had the same symptom with unity 6 beta.\n\nHow do i provide the necessary log files?\n\nBest regards",
